WEBVTT

00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:09.310
May you be blessed with God's
forgiveness and protection.

00:01:55.490 --> 00:01:59.960
True Self

00:02:01.090 --> 00:02:03.890
Runt, you know that man, don't you?

00:02:04.140 --> 00:02:05.760
Who do ya mean by that?

00:02:05.760 --> 00:02:07.140
Don't play the fool!

00:02:07.430 --> 00:02:10.510
The man we ran into yesterday...
the one with the same face as Sosuke.

00:02:11.180 --> 00:02:13.180
He knew all about you.

00:02:13.720 --> 00:02:15.150
But it was one-sided.

00:02:15.390 --> 00:02:16.500
Don't lie!

00:02:16.500 --> 00:02:17.910
You're trying to hide something!

00:02:17.910 --> 00:02:19.480
I'm not hidin' anything.

00:02:20.310 --> 00:02:22.480
Then I'll ask Sosuke instead!

00:02:22.480 --> 00:02:24.030
This has nothing to do with him!

00:02:24.110 --> 00:02:26.620
Like I buy that! Not with that face!

00:02:30.660 --> 00:02:32.540
Stop making a ruckus so
early in the morning.

00:02:34.160 --> 00:02:37.550
Asakeno, I'll bring a kimono
for you to change into.

00:02:37.830 --> 00:02:39.260
No need, Ma'am.

00:02:39.260 --> 00:02:40.930
I have spare clothes in my room...

00:02:41.250 --> 00:02:42.670
Don't you worry about it.

00:02:42.670 --> 00:02:46.090
You'll catch a cold if you don't
change out of that wet kimono soon.

00:02:47.470 --> 00:02:50.390
Jeez. He just had to get in my way.

00:02:52.050 --> 00:02:54.440
Shino, for yer clothes,

00:02:55.030 --> 00:02:56.940
I've got somethin' from
when I was a kid...

00:03:01.810 --> 00:03:03.150
S-sorry!

00:03:04.860 --> 00:03:06.510
We don't care if you come in.

00:03:06.900 --> 00:03:10.700
But, uh, even if Shino's
cool, I really couldn't...

00:03:10.990 --> 00:03:14.280
There is no need to look
away from a fellow man.

00:03:14.280 --> 00:03:15.370
It's freaky.

00:03:15.370 --> 00:03:18.840
No, no. I wasn't referring to Shino...

00:03:19.370 --> 00:03:20.590
You meant me, punk?

00:03:21.080 --> 00:03:25.230
Whoa, whoa, there! Ladies
shouldn't use harsh language.

00:03:30.050 --> 00:03:30.720
Look.

00:03:38.270 --> 00:03:40.950
M-m-m-m-male...?

00:03:40.950 --> 00:03:42.730
Yep. I'm a man.

00:03:43.090 --> 00:03:45.420
Jerk! That's fraud!

00:03:45.420 --> 00:03:46.990
I never did anything to deceive you.

00:03:47.610 --> 00:03:50.110
You... deceived me.

00:03:50.450 --> 00:03:52.330
Keno, that mark...

00:03:53.930 --> 00:03:57.270
Don't you have one similar to this
on your right arm?

00:03:57.830 --> 00:03:59.880
And Genpachi Inukai has
one on his cheek...

00:04:00.350 --> 00:04:01.900
Sosuke has one, too.

00:04:01.900 --> 00:04:03.140
It's on the nape of his neck.

00:04:04.030 --> 00:04:05.760
I've got one just like that myself!

00:04:06.090 --> 00:04:08.580
Sosuke told me! Isn't it around here?

00:04:09.390 --> 00:04:10.390
Knock that off!

00:04:10.390 --> 00:04:11.020
See?

00:04:13.720 --> 00:04:15.390
Watch it, you friggin' brat!

00:04:15.390 --> 00:04:16.500
What were you thinkin'?!

00:04:16.500 --> 00:04:19.650
It's not my fault. That's
where the mark is!

00:04:20.850 --> 00:04:22.940
So Keno has a similar mark as well...

00:04:23.770 --> 00:04:26.160
That is a rather puzzling coincidence.

00:04:26.360 --> 00:04:27.060
Yeah.

00:04:27.440 --> 00:04:29.370
Wouldn't it be sweet if all of the gems

00:04:29.370 --> 00:04:32.660
we're looking for gathered up
by coincidence, just like this?

00:04:33.610 --> 00:04:35.990
Come to think of it,
yesterday that shadow...

00:04:37.200 --> 00:04:39.240
They haven't fully gathered together.

00:04:41.370 --> 00:04:42.320
What the heck...

00:04:42.790 --> 00:04:44.020
...was he referring to?

00:04:49.840 --> 00:04:53.310
My, you're from the other day.
What a coincidence.

00:04:56.050 --> 00:04:57.470
Sometimes I visit this church

00:04:57.470 --> 00:05:01.370
since it's the closest to where
I live in the red-light district.

00:05:02.350 --> 00:05:03.990
I come to pray for my family.

00:05:04.350 --> 00:05:05.730
Your family?

00:05:06.650 --> 00:05:08.550
Believe it or not, I'm married.

00:05:08.900 --> 00:05:10.730
I still have a young child back home.

00:05:11.440 --> 00:05:13.200
Then why do you live in
the red-light district?

00:05:13.700 --> 00:05:15.430
That's a difficult question...

00:05:17.660 --> 00:05:19.770
Oh, sorry for asking
an awkward question.

00:05:19.770 --> 00:05:20.500
Not at all.

00:05:22.330 --> 00:05:26.690
I was born in a truly impoverished
village to the north.

00:05:27.340 --> 00:05:31.600
As the lady of the house,
I am simply doing what I can to help.

00:05:32.010 --> 00:05:35.550
Thanks to my hair and eye
color, I am quite popular.

00:05:36.050 --> 00:05:38.100
I'm already number one in our brothel.

00:05:38.350 --> 00:05:40.010
Y-yeah...?

00:05:41.160 --> 00:05:44.550
Of course, there are times when
I find what I do difficult.

00:05:45.980 --> 00:05:47.520
But it's for the sake of my family!

00:05:48.640 --> 00:05:50.540
Once a month, they send me a letter.

00:05:51.070 --> 00:05:53.220
It always says that they're
eagerly awaiting my return.

00:05:54.530 --> 00:05:58.180
The other day, I visited
that church to catch

00:05:58.180 --> 00:05:59.750
a glimpse of Dean Satomi.

00:06:00.950 --> 00:06:02.360
Isn't he a beautiful man?

00:06:05.050 --> 00:06:07.510
That was Kohaku from Winter Daphne Inn.

00:06:07.880 --> 00:06:10.030
The poor woman.

00:06:10.030 --> 00:06:13.260
She has neither a family
nor home whence to return.

00:06:13.420 --> 00:06:16.610
Huh? But she said that
she's married with a kid.

00:06:16.930 --> 00:06:18.110
Plus she's got parents and brothers.

00:06:18.550 --> 00:06:22.310
That woman was sold to a brothel
at the early age of eight.

00:06:22.310 --> 00:06:24.270
There is no way she could be married!

00:06:24.850 --> 00:06:29.780
Her hometown was a small village
by the northern border.

00:06:32.150 --> 00:06:34.030
Do you remember the hostage incident

00:06:34.030 --> 00:06:35.660
that occurred up north three years ago?

00:06:36.240 --> 00:06:37.570
Nope!

00:06:37.570 --> 00:06:39.510
There was an incident where bandits

00:06:39.510 --> 00:06:43.170
from the northern neighboring country
took some villagers as hostages.

00:06:43.990 --> 00:06:45.080
Everyone died.

00:06:45.580 --> 00:06:48.540
Princess Sai was the only one
that made it out unscathed.

00:06:50.250 --> 00:06:51.550
It couldn't be...

00:06:55.010 --> 00:06:58.060
I am married...

00:06:58.340 --> 00:07:02.630
Back home my family is eagerly
awaiting my return...

00:07:07.430 --> 00:07:08.940
Kohaku, you decent?

00:07:09.980 --> 00:07:11.770
Oh, Young Master Shoichi.

00:07:11.770 --> 00:07:13.480
Please don't call me "Young Master".

00:07:13.480 --> 00:07:15.200
It doesn't matter if
I'm the owner's son.

00:07:15.900 --> 00:07:17.330
I hear there's a problem with your eye.

00:07:17.990 --> 00:07:19.080
It's just pinkeye.

00:07:20.660 --> 00:07:21.660
I see...

00:07:22.490 --> 00:07:23.940
You should get your rest.

00:07:24.370 --> 00:07:27.210
I am, but I was growing restless.

00:07:27.750 --> 00:07:30.180
I went to kill some time at
the church this afternoon.

00:07:31.110 --> 00:07:33.220
Did you see that Dean Satomi
everyone is talking about?

00:07:33.730 --> 00:07:35.460
Just from a distance.

00:07:36.210 --> 00:07:38.340
He was beautiful, just
as the rumors claimed.

00:07:39.220 --> 00:07:40.790
I'm jealous!

00:07:40.790 --> 00:07:42.560
You've really taken a liking to him.

00:07:42.930 --> 00:07:46.020
Goodness, I didn't mean it like that!

00:07:46.550 --> 00:07:48.110
Dean Satomi is a terrifying man.

00:07:48.600 --> 00:07:51.830
You know all about what happened
to my village, now don't you?

00:08:01.360 --> 00:08:03.320
What are you doing here?

00:08:09.000 --> 00:08:11.880
You were wonderful, Satomi, my boy!

00:08:12.370 --> 00:08:14.860
It's most inconvenient when
you specifically request

00:08:14.860 --> 00:08:17.390
that I deliver your
parcels from the church.

00:08:18.060 --> 00:08:19.410
How could you say that?

00:08:19.410 --> 00:08:24.020
When you were a wee lad,
we were the ones who looked after you!

00:08:27.770 --> 00:08:30.230
Even you don't stand a chance
against these two?

00:08:30.230 --> 00:08:31.400
Awesome!

00:08:32.140 --> 00:08:35.160
Shino, how has your search
for the gems been proceeding?

00:08:35.360 --> 00:08:37.780
Oh, uh... I'm working on it.

00:08:38.150 --> 00:08:41.490
If you persist to slack on the job,
I will fully cut your allowance.

00:08:41.820 --> 00:08:43.420
I'm not slackin' off!

00:08:44.260 --> 00:08:45.910
Satomi, you're a scrooge!

00:08:46.660 --> 00:08:47.790
Satomi?

00:08:55.750 --> 00:08:57.140
Hey, you!

00:08:58.920 --> 00:09:02.310
Kid, do you live at the church?
Are you close to Dean Satomi?

00:09:02.550 --> 00:09:05.420
Nah, not really...

00:09:05.420 --> 00:09:07.560
But you just said his name so casually.

00:09:07.760 --> 00:09:11.710
Yeah... I'm not sure you'd call us close,
but he's my guardian.

00:09:13.020 --> 00:09:14.230
Are you a practitioner as well?

00:09:14.230 --> 00:09:15.430
Oh, not really.

00:09:15.840 --> 00:09:18.950
One of my friends often talks
about Dean Satomi, so...

00:09:19.360 --> 00:09:21.030
This is from that friend...

00:09:21.530 --> 00:09:23.460
I bet it was meant for you.

00:09:23.820 --> 00:09:25.210
Would your friend happen to be Kohaku?

00:09:25.490 --> 00:09:27.490
Sure is. She had me bring this over.

00:09:27.490 --> 00:09:29.340
Wow, madeleine cakes!

00:09:29.340 --> 00:09:30.790
Looks good!

00:09:32.330 --> 00:09:34.870
Shino! Shino!

00:09:35.670 --> 00:09:37.050
I'm about ready to call it a...

00:09:37.380 --> 00:09:39.390
Dear Sosuke,
They're mine!

00:09:37.840 --> 00:09:38.490
Huh?

00:09:39.390 --> 00:09:42.390
Winter
Daphne Inn

00:09:43.840 --> 00:09:45.890
Shoichi, what were you thinking?!

00:09:46.010 --> 00:09:48.900
Well, I thought you'd be pleased.

00:09:49.140 --> 00:09:53.120
Hardly! I just wanted
to thank this child!

00:09:53.120 --> 00:09:54.900
Have him leave immediately.

00:09:55.140 --> 00:09:56.930
B-but he came all this way...

00:09:57.440 --> 00:09:58.400
Kohaku?

00:09:58.650 --> 00:09:59.810
Go home!

00:10:04.450 --> 00:10:06.080
I'm sorry for yelling.

00:10:06.700 --> 00:10:08.660
This isn't any place for a child.

00:10:09.190 --> 00:10:09.770
Okay?

00:10:10.490 --> 00:10:11.310
Got it.

00:10:11.810 --> 00:10:13.370
Sorry for dropping in unannounced.

00:10:13.870 --> 00:10:15.300
That's okay.

00:10:15.300 --> 00:10:16.720
I'll walk you back to the church.

00:10:17.580 --> 00:10:19.300
I can't have that.

00:10:19.500 --> 00:10:20.810
Shoichi...?

00:10:20.810 --> 00:10:23.170
This kid's guardian is none
other than Dean Satomi!

00:10:23.170 --> 00:10:23.900
What?

00:10:25.090 --> 00:10:28.910
The very Dean Satomi that
allowed your family to die!

00:10:29.800 --> 00:10:32.150
If we use this kid right, we could get

00:10:32.150 --> 00:10:33.940
Dean Satomi to apologize
for what he did.

00:10:34.180 --> 00:10:36.690
I don't need any apologies!

00:10:37.370 --> 00:10:39.490
Don't you want to soothe
your family's anger?

00:10:39.940 --> 00:10:41.950
What are you talking about?

00:10:42.270 --> 00:10:44.880
We could even kill this kid
and throw the corpse in his face.

00:10:45.650 --> 00:10:48.700
It's a fitting punishment
for that murderer, don't you think?

00:10:49.290 --> 00:10:50.870
Are you a moron or what?

00:10:50.870 --> 00:10:54.040
There's no way that would make
Satomi bow down to you.

00:10:54.310 --> 00:10:55.840
Don't pay any attention to him.

00:11:00.500 --> 00:11:03.240
Your heart will be frozen
until you avenge

00:11:03.240 --> 00:11:05.140
your family and ease their anger.

00:11:05.920 --> 00:11:09.030
Isn't that why you turned
me down when I proposed?

00:11:10.100 --> 00:11:11.820
You must be suffering in misery.

00:11:12.720 --> 00:11:14.760
Besides, it's important
to show a child his place.

00:11:14.760 --> 00:11:17.570
Especially when it comes to
loud-mouthed brats like you.

00:11:20.900 --> 00:11:21.970
Kohaku, what are you doing?!

00:11:22.900 --> 00:11:23.270
You don't need this...!

00:11:23.270 --> 00:11:24.610
Stop it, Kohaku!
You don't need this...!

00:11:40.180 --> 00:11:40.840
No!

00:11:44.130 --> 00:11:45.840
Crap...

00:12:04.060 --> 00:12:05.910
Mura... same...

00:12:15.530 --> 00:12:18.170
Winter
Daphne Inn

00:12:16.540 --> 00:12:18.170
Damn it, Kohaku!

00:12:19.040 --> 00:12:21.040
The customers are driving us nuts

00:12:21.040 --> 00:12:22.700
asking why you aren't available today...

00:12:24.380 --> 00:12:27.430
Damn it! Where the hell did that man go?

00:12:33.440 --> 00:12:37.190
Winter
Daphne Inn

00:12:34.010 --> 00:12:37.190
Goodness, Captain Inukai!
What brings you here?

00:12:37.630 --> 00:12:40.060
Someone reported that a child got shot.

00:12:40.060 --> 00:12:41.070
He's over here!

00:12:46.650 --> 00:12:47.400
Shino!

00:12:48.400 --> 00:12:51.080
Damn it! Why were you...?!

00:12:51.320 --> 00:12:53.070
It's too late.

00:12:53.070 --> 00:12:54.300
He got shot in the neck.

00:12:54.300 --> 00:12:55.360
He isn't even breathing.

00:12:55.360 --> 00:12:56.280
Shino!

00:12:57.530 --> 00:12:59.820
The wound... is closing up?

00:13:00.830 --> 00:13:03.590
You're certain that he
was shot in the neck?

00:13:03.830 --> 00:13:06.590
That's right. Look at
all of the blood...

00:13:06.590 --> 00:13:08.340
And where is the shooter?

00:13:10.920 --> 00:13:11.970
He got devoured.

00:13:27.270 --> 00:13:29.570
Where are you taking him? Let me-

00:13:30.760 --> 00:13:32.120
I am not obligated to bring you along.

00:13:32.570 --> 00:13:34.490
Don't approach this child ever again.

00:13:40.240 --> 00:13:42.740
Normally, he should be cold dead, but...

00:13:49.920 --> 00:13:50.840
A dog spirit!

00:13:56.430 --> 00:13:57.780
Rio Satomi...!

00:13:59.520 --> 00:14:03.090
Kenro Hotel

00:14:04.040 --> 00:14:05.020
Genpachi!

00:14:06.310 --> 00:14:08.720
Sosuke, I'm amazed you
knew where to find us.

00:14:09.230 --> 00:14:11.300
Yatsufusa informed me.

00:14:11.300 --> 00:14:12.670
What exactly happened?

00:14:13.360 --> 00:14:14.770
I don't know the details.

00:14:15.420 --> 00:14:17.130
Satomi brought us here.

00:14:18.120 --> 00:14:21.550
Sosuke, is Shino just
like Kobungo and me?

00:14:22.330 --> 00:14:24.420
He... isn't the same by any means.

00:14:25.080 --> 00:14:26.550
It is far more terrifying...

00:14:27.000 --> 00:14:28.370
And far more cruel.

00:14:30.250 --> 00:14:32.160
His wound has healed.

00:14:32.160 --> 00:14:34.500
But he isn't breathing and lacks a pulse.

00:14:35.300 --> 00:14:38.060
The rest depends on Murasame's whims.

00:14:38.390 --> 00:14:39.270
No...!

00:14:40.300 --> 00:14:41.240
Shino!

00:14:44.310 --> 00:14:47.200
So hungry... Starving to death...

00:14:48.590 --> 00:14:50.810
The corpse said that it's about to die.

00:14:50.810 --> 00:14:51.860
Toss him out.

00:14:51.860 --> 00:14:54.790
Sosuke, my madeleine cakes...

00:14:58.570 --> 00:15:01.290
It would seem that Murasame's aura
is growing stronger.

00:15:02.830 --> 00:15:04.810
I wonder if something happened to Shino.

00:15:09.630 --> 00:15:11.250
What an appetite, sheesh!

00:15:11.590 --> 00:15:15.220
Do you even realize what condition
you were in mere moments ago?

00:15:15.550 --> 00:15:17.720
Yeah, I was dead, huh?

00:15:17.720 --> 00:15:19.400
Seriously, that wasn't too hot.

00:15:19.760 --> 00:15:22.530
The old fart was one of those
nasty types to deal with.

00:15:23.470 --> 00:15:26.200
I could find neither hide nor hair
left of that "old fart".

00:15:26.780 --> 00:15:28.540
I bet Murasame ate him.

00:15:29.440 --> 00:15:31.410
The jerk pulled out a gun.

00:15:31.410 --> 00:15:33.010
He was real bad news.

00:15:33.390 --> 00:15:35.970
Shino, you know better than to

00:15:35.970 --> 00:15:37.560
recklessly approach someone with a gun.

00:15:37.560 --> 00:15:40.000
I'm fine. It's not
like I can die anyway.

00:15:41.700 --> 00:15:42.810
He was a total pushover,

00:15:42.810 --> 00:15:44.750
but he underestimated
me and tried to throw his weight around.

00:15:45.450 --> 00:15:48.380
It looked like he was
giving Kohaku a hard time,

00:15:48.380 --> 00:15:49.990
so I was gonna give him a bit of a scare.

00:15:51.000 --> 00:15:53.850
This was supposed to
be a little scratch.

00:15:53.850 --> 00:15:55.250
Messed up big with that.

00:16:01.760 --> 00:16:03.720
So! What the hell was that for?!

00:16:03.720 --> 00:16:05.990
Please pull your head out of your ass.

00:16:05.990 --> 00:16:07.150
It's unsightly.

00:16:07.390 --> 00:16:09.500
But... it's all true.

00:16:10.730 --> 00:16:11.990
I will not die!

00:16:13.440 --> 00:16:14.900
I cannot believe I am hearing that

00:16:14.900 --> 00:16:16.370
from the person who could have died

00:16:16.370 --> 00:16:18.250
at any given moment until five years ago.

00:16:23.070 --> 00:16:24.070
Dammit!

00:16:26.160 --> 00:16:28.670
Are you sure you want to
leave Shino like this?

00:16:29.620 --> 00:16:32.510
You know he isn't the
type to come out and say,

00:16:32.510 --> 00:16:34.180
"I'm sorry for making your worry."

00:16:34.420 --> 00:16:35.370
I'm well aware.

00:16:36.250 --> 00:16:39.180
He could be crying by himself
over what he's done.

00:16:39.920 --> 00:16:41.180
Not him.

00:16:42.410 --> 00:16:44.590
Sosuke's such a jerk!

00:16:44.980 --> 00:16:46.690
What's wrong with what I did?!

00:16:46.690 --> 00:16:47.650
Dammit!

00:16:48.850 --> 00:16:50.020
Satisfied yet?

00:16:50.640 --> 00:16:51.870
You should go to bed for the day.

00:16:52.560 --> 00:16:54.170
Don't leave this room for a while.

00:16:54.980 --> 00:16:56.950
Yatsufusa has set up a barrier.

00:16:57.110 --> 00:16:59.450
What?! What's with the barrier?

00:17:00.400 --> 00:17:04.280
Don't you sense what Murasame
is doing inside of your

00:17:04.280 --> 00:17:05.690
body at this very moment?

00:17:05.700 --> 00:17:06.950
Whatcha mean?

00:17:06.950 --> 00:17:08.460
He's the same as always...

00:17:20.510 --> 00:17:23.230
Shino will be okay. He survived.

00:17:24.590 --> 00:17:27.980
Apparently he entered a death-like state
after losing so much blood.

00:17:28.470 --> 00:17:30.060
The moment he awoke,

00:17:30.060 --> 00:17:32.690
he started begging
for the cakes you gave him.

00:17:35.650 --> 00:17:38.410
Today was the first day
I have prayed so hard

00:17:38.410 --> 00:17:40.550
to God, and probably the last.

00:17:41.070 --> 00:17:43.390
I am sorry to have made you worry.

00:17:44.000 --> 00:17:45.730
I am the one who should apologize.

00:17:46.220 --> 00:17:48.000
It's my fault he got involved.

00:17:48.450 --> 00:17:51.020
Shino was the one who
chose to get involved.

00:17:51.510 --> 00:17:53.110
Do not blame yourself.

00:17:54.250 --> 00:17:56.760
He... felt sorry for me.

00:17:57.540 --> 00:18:00.790
He saw through everything-
all of my lies.

00:18:01.900 --> 00:18:05.170
Aren't I horrible, telling
lies to earn his sympathy?

00:18:05.650 --> 00:18:08.760
I believe you did that
because you are lonely.

00:18:09.890 --> 00:18:13.550
No one would frown at being treated kindly,
even if it were out of sympathy.

00:18:13.930 --> 00:18:18.480
Well, there are some rare exceptions
to the rule, like Shino.

00:18:24.570 --> 00:18:25.700
Was that Shino's?

00:18:25.950 --> 00:18:26.760
Yes,

00:18:27.930 --> 00:18:29.800
but I should probably return it.

00:18:30.310 --> 00:18:31.920
This is important to him.

00:18:31.920 --> 00:18:32.660
No...

00:18:33.620 --> 00:18:35.790
If Shino gave that to
you, then keep it...

00:18:38.630 --> 00:18:39.680
Thank you.

00:18:41.710 --> 00:18:44.940
As I thought, he isn't the
same man I met before...

00:18:46.180 --> 00:18:48.460
He's much... warmer.

00:18:49.890 --> 00:18:51.010
Shall I escort you back?

00:18:51.560 --> 00:18:53.690
I'm fine. I can get back on my own.

00:18:57.690 --> 00:19:00.200
Stay away from that woman.

00:19:02.690 --> 00:19:05.950
Her soul has already been
severed from this world.

00:19:12.120 --> 00:19:14.960
She has strayed from the natural laws.

00:19:19.220 --> 00:19:23.310
Only a strong desire
keeps that woman alive.

00:19:27.630 --> 00:19:28.600
Damn it...!

00:19:29.590 --> 00:19:32.730
My entire body suddenly started
to burn like it's on fire.

00:19:35.890 --> 00:19:40.110
It's like... I'm becoming
more and more like a monster.

00:19:42.110 --> 00:19:44.040
Please pull your head out of your ass.

00:19:46.530 --> 00:19:48.720
I'm sick of not being
able to protect people.

00:19:50.490 --> 00:19:53.830
I'm sick of people getting
hurt trying to protect me.

00:19:54.790 --> 00:19:57.250
It's more painful than if
my body were torn asunder.

00:19:58.540 --> 00:20:00.010
"If only I had power..."

00:20:00.670 --> 00:20:02.200
I wished so hard for power,

00:20:03.340 --> 00:20:05.250
and then I got exactly what I wanted.

00:20:06.920 --> 00:20:09.870
That's why I don't have any regrets.

00:20:21.980 --> 00:20:23.980
Shino, are you all right?

00:20:25.770 --> 00:20:26.890
This voice...

00:20:27.810 --> 00:20:28.630
I know...

00:20:29.530 --> 00:20:31.970
I've heard it somewhere... as a child...

00:20:36.330 --> 00:20:38.950
It... It hurts!

00:20:38.950 --> 00:20:39.800
Shino!

00:20:47.210 --> 00:20:50.060
Not enough... Need more...!

00:20:50.720 --> 00:20:53.720
I am starving... Starving...!

00:20:54.010 --> 00:20:56.180
That wasn't nearly enough!

00:21:00.930 --> 00:21:03.760
That's right. I had forgotten.

00:21:04.400 --> 00:21:08.800
In all actuality, you should
have been turning 18.

00:21:10.650 --> 00:21:13.710
More... Need more...

00:21:14.240 --> 00:21:16.320
Consuming one life wasn't enough?

00:21:17.330 --> 00:21:20.340
I will admit, you lost
far too much blood.

00:21:20.750 --> 00:21:22.590
In that case, I will feast...

00:21:28.040 --> 00:21:31.480
My throat... It's so dry that it burns!

00:21:32.550 --> 00:21:35.810
What am I...?

00:21:42.730 --> 00:21:44.890
Pipe down, Yatsufusa...

00:21:45.940 --> 00:21:48.430
I don't mind if that's all he wants.

00:21:50.860 --> 00:21:54.140
This too, must be one of my duties.

00:23:26.040 --> 00:23:41.050
Compensation

00:23:27.120 --> 00:23:29.460
What did you do to poor Kobungo?

00:23:29.460 --> 00:23:30.250
Huh?

00:23:30.250 --> 00:23:31.500
He's curled up in bed.

00:23:31.500 --> 00:23:33.670
All I did was tell him that I'm a guy.

00:23:33.670 --> 00:23:34.710
That's why he's...?

00:23:37.550 --> 00:23:40.680
I've never seen Kokonoe
laugh so hard before.
